{"source_id":"W740","platform":"RSS","author":"GamesIndustry.biz","account_type":"メディア","text":"The Big Picture: What you need to know about the ongoing games industry reset\n<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/reset-button-NES-black-background.png?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp\" /> <p>The games industry is undergoing a reset. That was the message of Gamescom Dev's opening keynote, delivered by Amir Satvat, who until a few days ago was business development manager at Tencent, but is <a href=\"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/jobs-roundup-september-2026-amir-satvat-joins-1up-ventures-as-a-general-partner\">now general partner at 1Up Ventures</a>.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/the-big-picture-what-you-need-to-know-about-the-ongoing-games-industry-reset\">Read more</a></p>","url":"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/the-big-picture-what-you-need-to-know-about-the-ongoing-games-industry-reset","timestamp":"2026-09-01T16:19:14Z","extra":{"source_priority":"medium","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
{"source_id":"W740","platform":"RSS","author":"GamesIndustry.biz","account_type":"メディア","text":"Brian Ward steps down as Savvy Games Group CEO\n<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/Brian-Ward.jpg?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp\" /> <p>Brian Ward is stepping down as CEO of Savvy Games Group, according to a staff note obtained by <a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-09-01/saudi-video-game-giant-savvy-ceo-brian-ward-is-stepping-down?accessToken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzb3VyY2UiOiJTdWJzY3JpYmVyR2lmdGVkQXJ0aWNsZSIsImlhdCI6MTc4ODI2NzQ1MSwiZXhwIjoxNzg4ODcyMjUxLCJhcnRpY2xlSWQiOiJUS05DSklUOTZPU0kwMCIsImJjb25uZWN0SWQiOiJGRUIzODlCNUI2ODI0RTY0QjY5MENEODE1RTBDREZGRCJ9.y225ht8jDlTbFQN7glMJ1PY4kfglpkZsnfo3vBz4dd4&amp;leadSource=article-gifting\"> Bloomberg</a>.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/brian-ward-steps-down-as-savvy-games-group-ceo\">Read more</a></p>","url":"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/brian-ward-steps-down-as-savvy-games-group-ceo","timestamp":"2026-09-01T14:38:11Z","extra":{"source_priority":"medium","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
{"source_id":"W740","platform":"RSS","author":"GamesIndustry.biz","account_type":"メディア","text":"Jobs roundup: September 2026 | Amir Satvat joins 1Up Ventures as a general partner\n<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/Amir-Satvat--GBN23-(1)-(1)_16x9.png?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp\" /> <p><em>It can be difficult keeping track of the various comings and goings in the games industry, which is why we compile them in semi-regular round-ups.</em></p> <p><a href=\"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/jobs-roundup-september-2026-amir-satvat-joins-1up-ventures-as-a-general-partner\">Read more</a></p>","url":"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/jobs-roundup-september-2026-amir-satvat-joins-1up-ventures-as-a-general-partner","timestamp":"2026-09-01T13:41:11Z","extra":{"source_priority":"medium","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
{"source_id":"W740","platform":"RSS","author":"GamesIndustry.biz","account_type":"メディア","text":"UKIE launches Discord-backed Go To Market Academy, a business program to support early-stage indie devs\n<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/Discord-go-to-market-academy-1536x787-(1).png?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp\" /> <p>UKIE has partnered with Discord and GameFlex to launch the <a href=\"https://ukie.org.uk/news/ukie-launches-go-to-market-academy-in-partnership-with-discord-to-support-uk-indie-games-studios/\"> Go To Market Academy</a>, a business program to support UK-based indie studios.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/ukie-launches-discord-backed-go-to-market-academy-a-business-program-to-support-early-stage-indie-devs\">Read more</a></p>","url":"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/ukie-launches-discord-backed-go-to-market-academy-a-business-program-to-support-early-stage-indie-devs","timestamp":"2026-09-01T12:42:51Z","extra":{"source_priority":"medium","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
{"source_id":"W740","platform":"RSS","author":"GamesIndustry.biz","account_type":"メディア","text":"Gamescom 2026 attendance rose 6% to 368,000 visitors\n<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/gamescom-2026-booths-3.jpg?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp\" /> <p>Gamescom 2026 attracted 368,000 visitors from 131 countries, a 6% increase over the previous year.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gamescom-2026-attendance-rose-6-to-368000-visitors\">Read more</a></p>","url":"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/gamescom-2026-attendance-rose-6-to-368000-visitors","timestamp":"2026-09-01T10:32:51Z","extra":{"source_priority":"medium","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
{"source_id":"W740","platform":"RSS","author":"GamesIndustry.biz","account_type":"メディア","text":"Rovio closes Copenhagen studio following shut down of Sonic Blitz\n<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/sonic-blitz.jpg?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp\" /> <p>Rovio has closed its Copenhagen studio after cancelling its mobile title Sonic Blitz.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/rovio-closes-copenhagen-studio-following-shut-down-of-sonic-blitz\">Read more</a></p>","url":"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/rovio-closes-copenhagen-studio-following-shut-down-of-sonic-blitz","timestamp":"2026-09-01T08:47:50Z","extra":{"source_priority":"medium","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
{"source_id":"W740","platform":"RSS","author":"GamesIndustry.biz","account_type":"メディア","text":"Bit Reactor furloughed \"many of its workers\" in the weeks before Star Wars Zero Company's launch\n<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/star-wars-zero-company_OixT1yY.webp?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp\" /> <p>Star Wars Zero Company developer Bit Reactor furloughed \"many of its workers\" prior to the game's release.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/bit-reactor-furloughed-many-of-its-workers-in-the-weeks-before-star-wars-zero-companys-launch\">Read more</a></p>","url":"https://www.gamesindustry.biz/bit-reactor-furloughed-many-of-its-workers-in-the-weeks-before-star-wars-zero-companys-launch","timestamp":"2026-09-01T08:07:34Z","extra":{"source_priority":"medium","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
